     "time"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Speed equals distance divided by time. 120 km divided by 3 hours is 40 km per hour.\nIf we know speed and time, distance equals speed times time. 40 km per hour for 2 hours is 80 km.\nTime equals distance divided by speed."
    }
